# device dumps: persist/modemst/fsg hold IMEI + calibration; live DT holds the serial
backup/
dtb/
recovery/
# third-party/Apple sources fetched for reading
research/
shim/out/
xnu/out/
xnu/out-*/
__pycache__/
# Apple artifacts and built images stay local: IPSW, extracted volume images, ADTs,
# root images (they contain Apple code and, for ADTs, iPhone X device-tree data)
*.ipsw
*.dmg
*.adt
ios16-root*.img
ios16-root*.simg
root*.img
